1
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:07,239
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:07,239 --> 00:00:09,094
Hide Your Identity!

3
00:00:10,394 --> 00:00:13,858
{Jun} Hey, everyone! Jun here!

4
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:17,596
{Jun} Let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together!

5
00:00:17,596 --> 00:00:20,863
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:20,863 --> 00:00:23,808
Phoenix Fire, setup!

7
00:00:24,008 --> 00:00:25,225
{Phoenix Fire} Hello, everyone.

8
00:00:25,225 --> 00:00:27,642
{Phoenix Fire} My name is Phoenix Fire!

9
00:00:27,642 --> 00:00:30,597
{Phoenix Fire} It's nice to see all of you again, friends!

10
00:00:30,597 --> 00:00:33,101
{Jun} It's nice to see you again, Phoenix Fire!

11
00:00:33,101 --> 00:00:36,667
{Jun} Today, let's see what all the commotion was about

12
00:00:36,667 --> 00:00:38,634
{Jun} when Anna came over to my house!

13
00:00:38,634 --> 00:00:41,566
{Jun} So, shall we get started?

14
00:00:44,563 --> 00:00:47,723
Hey, Dad! Do you know what day it is tomorrow?

15
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:50,494
Tell me, what day is it tomorrow? 🎵

16
00:00:50,494 --> 00:00:52,682
Did you forget? I'll give you a hint, it's-

17
00:00:52,682 --> 00:00:55,296
Is it our son's turn to do the chores?

18
00:00:55,296 --> 00:00:57,394
No, no, it's something more special than-

19
00:00:57,394 --> 00:01:01,222
Is it time for spring cleaning? Your room is getting pretty messy, after all.

20
00:01:01,222 --> 00:01:05,412
I would appreciate it if you could clean the garage and mow the lawn while you're at it. Eh?

21
00:01:05,412 --> 00:01:07,356
Ugh... Tch.

22
00:01:07,356 --> 00:01:10,375
{Phoenix Fire} Jun! You mustn't leave your room a mess!

23
00:01:10,375 --> 00:01:12,295
{Phoenix Fire} It should always be clean!

24
00:01:12,295 --> 00:01:16,312
{Jun} No! It's not that dirty... is it?

25
00:01:16,312 --> 00:01:20,087
{Phoenix Fire} If your room is messy, germs and bugs can breed and spread!

26
00:01:20,087 --> 00:01:20,962
{Phoenix Fire} Causing colds and various diseases-

27
00:01:20,962 --> 00:01:25,102
{Jun} Ugh. You're nagging me too much, Phoenix Fire!

28
00:01:25,102 --> 00:01:25,900
Wait... Vera, do you have a crush on-

29
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,146
No!

30
00:01:27,146 --> 00:01:30,310
I'm just keeping an eye on him. I'm going to find out his secret!

31
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:31,351
Secret?

32
00:01:31,351 --> 00:01:35,577
Yes! It's something so top secret that even FBI agents would be rushing after him!

33
00:01:35,577 --> 00:01:36,797
You'd better watch out!

34
00:01:38,974 --> 00:01:40,624
Top secret...?

35
00:01:43,588 --> 00:01:48,228
It's my birthday, so why do I have to mow the lawn?!

36
00:01:48,228 --> 00:01:51,892
Both Mom and Dad aren't showing any love for their son today.

37
00:01:51,892 --> 00:01:53,678
Jun, whatcha doin'?

38
00:01:53,678 --> 00:01:56,173
Can't you see? I'm mowing the lawn!

39
00:01:56,173 --> 00:01:59,077
It looks fun! Let me try, let me try!

40
00:01:59,077 --> 00:02:00,172
Whaa?

41
00:02:05,204 --> 00:02:06,844
Woohoo!

42
00:02:06,844 --> 00:02:08,098
Having fun?

43
00:02:08,798 --> 00:02:11,182
Haha! This is the best!

44
00:02:11,182 --> 00:02:12,257
{Phoenix Fire} Wow!

45
00:02:12,257 --> 00:02:15,732
{Phoenix Fire} I also want to clean the houses that the people of Earth live in!

46
00:02:15,732 --> 00:02:16,563
{Jun} What?

47
00:02:16,563 --> 00:02:19,894
{Jun} Why does everyone find cleaning so fun?

48
00:02:19,894 --> 00:02:23,936
{Phoenix Fire} Jun, can I clean it with my water cannon using Water Splash?

49
00:02:23,936 --> 00:02:25,867
{Jun} Ah, no way!

50
00:02:25,867 --> 00:02:29,398
{Jun} If you do that, my house would get blown to bits!

51
00:02:29,598 --> 00:02:33,593
What if someone sees them? We agreed to keep Metal Cardbots a secret.

52
00:02:33,593 --> 00:02:35,840
That's right, but...

53
00:02:40,748 --> 00:02:42,406
Hello!

54
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,864
H-Heyyy!

55
00:02:44,864 --> 00:02:47,154
It's an emergency! Hurry, hurry, transform!

56
00:02:47,154 --> 00:02:48,636
This is bad!

57
00:02:49,503 --> 00:02:51,980
Sorry for dropping in like this. Is now a bad time?

58
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:56,129
Of course not! You guys are always welcome here!

59
00:02:56,129 --> 00:02:58,491
I'm glad! What were you up to?

60
00:02:58,491 --> 00:03:00,964
Uh... Just some yard work?

61
00:03:00,964 --> 00:03:02,496
Wow! Can I see?

62
00:03:02,496 --> 00:03:08,231
B-b-b-but Anna! I-It's not done yet!

63
00:03:09,489 --> 00:03:11,334
Why is there a truck in your yard?

64
00:03:11,334 --> 00:03:14,560
Uh, someone just asked me to take care of it!

65
00:03:15,664 --> 00:03:19,240
Aah! Hey! Wait!

66
00:03:21,184 --> 00:03:22,396
Why don't we-

67
00:03:25,714 --> 00:03:26,660
Aah!

68
00:03:26,660 --> 00:03:28,829
Shadow X, stealth mode on!

69
00:03:28,829 --> 00:03:30,580
Stop that. What are you doing?

70
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:31,661
{Phoenix Fire} Phew~

71
00:03:31,661 --> 00:03:34,142
{Phoenix Fire} That was a close one, Jun!

72
00:03:34,142 --> 00:03:37,564
{Jun} I didn't expect Anna to come over.

73
00:03:37,564 --> 00:03:39,295
{Phoenix Fire} I understand, Jun.

74
00:03:39,295 --> 00:03:43,127
{Phoenix Fire} If a girl you like comes to you, you can't refuse her.

75
00:03:43,127 --> 00:03:47,154
{Jun} Wh-what does that mean, Phoenix Fire?!

76
00:03:47,154 --> 00:03:49,045
{Jun} It’s not like that!

77
00:03:49,465 --> 00:03:52,914
Maybe he was taken hostage by robbers!

78
00:03:52,914 --> 00:03:54,100
{Jun} Eh?? 

79
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:57,786
{Jun} You came running because you thought I was taken hostage?!

80
00:03:57,786 --> 00:04:04,490
{Phoenix Fire} Blue Cop worries about Jun too much!

81
00:04:16,757 --> 00:04:18,024
What was that?

82
00:04:18,024 --> 00:04:19,922
It sounded like a car accident!

83
00:04:19,922 --> 00:04:21,778
Anyway, let's blow out the candles!

84
00:04:21,778 --> 00:04:24,258
Yes! Let's sing Happy Birthday now!

85
00:04:24,258 --> 00:04:26,035
1, 2, 3!

86
00:04:26,035 --> 00:04:30,211
Happy birthday to me...

87
00:04:39,049 --> 00:04:40,061
Hello.

88
00:04:41,221 --> 00:04:43,693
Aah!!

89
00:04:43,693 --> 00:04:46,906
{Phoenix Fire} Mowtown was almost completely destroyed!

90
00:04:46,906 --> 00:04:52,453
{Jun} Blue Cop, I'll have to make you write a 100 page essay reflecting on today!

91
00:04:52,974 --> 00:04:54,831
{Jun} Well, everyone?

92
00:04:54,831 --> 00:04:59,857
{Jun} In the end, we were caught by Anna and the Metal Cardbots' identity was revealed.

93
00:04:59,857 --> 00:05:04,393
{Jun} I hope you look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

